    description: "DEEP bakeoff cohort #20 (podman-desktop): 180 false-positive graphql_resolver nodes detected in a repo with zero GraphQL. Pattern matcher triggers on TypeScript object property access patterns that superficially resemble resolvers. Fix: require GraphQL dependency in package.json or presence of .graphql schema files before emitting graphql_resolver nodes. Also: 35 false-positive redis:subscribe (mq_subscriber) nodes from Svelte store subscriptions."  # f5d2
